# more_fonts — external bundled fonts for share/fonts/truetype/.
#
# The font families (DejaVu, Carlito, Croscore, Crosextra, Gentium) are not
# bundled in the source tree; each makefile.mk downloads a tarball from an
# external host (SourceForge, Google, SIL) and extracts the TTF files.
#
# Blocker: SourceForge uses token-based redirect URLs that change per request,
# making them incompatible with Bazel's http_archive (which requires stable,
# content-addressed URLs).  Deferred until a mirror with stable URLs is found
# or the fonts are vendored into ext_libraries/.
#
# The OpenSymbol font (opens___.ttf) is shipped with the OOo source tree under
# extras/source/truetype/ and is staged via //main/extras:opensymbol_ttf.
#
# fc_local.conf (fontconfig alias file) is Linux-only; no Windows staging needed.
